module mixcmp .
rem run: in_range 3 1 5
rem run: in_range 9 1 5

fn in_range input x u64 . input lo u64 . input hi u64 . output bool .
do
  rem ko: 비교가 `and` 보다 강하므로 괄호 없이 섞어도 뜻이 하나다 /// en: comparison binds tighter than `and`, so mixing without parentheses has one meaning
  return expr lo le x and x le hi .
end
